  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mfenced></math> be a real matrix of order <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo></math> Then, the sum of all the entries of the matrix <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math> is equal to:"
  },
