  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>11</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>12</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>13</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>21</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>22</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>23</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>31</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>32</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>33</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Then, we have&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>11</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>12</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>13</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>21</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>22</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>23</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>31</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>32</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>33</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>11</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>12</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>13</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>21</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>22</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>23</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>31</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>32</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>33</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>11</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>12</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>13</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>21</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>22</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>23</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>31</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>32</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>33</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Pre&nbsp;multiply by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>X</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>From&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;we get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>X</mi></math></p><p>Again, pre&nbsp;multiply by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>X</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>From&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;we get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>X</mi></math></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Thus, the sum of all the elements is<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
